# Pre-DB JSON history (superseded, kept untracked — see data/psychochat.sqlite below)
/data/mock-scores.json
/data/history/

# data/psychochat.sqlite is intentionally TRACKED (not ignored), despite
# being generated data: Vercel's serverless functions have no persistent
# writable filesystem, so this committed file is what actually ships as the
# live site's data. Stopgap until this moves to a real hosted DB — until
# then, updating live data means: run `npm run assess` locally, then
# `git add data/psychochat.sqlite` + commit + push to redeploy.
